; Post-graduation (axis D on): the overlay yields `kind = kick`,
; so variant `kick` is selected and `:sequence` (a bass-only key)
; is rejected as `unknown_key`. The author-only baseline would
; also emit `missing_discriminant_key`; axis-D suppresses that
; verdict because the discriminant is satisfied via the overlay.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code unknown_key :path [track sequence]))
